vgs-shell (0.4.0-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Full-screen wallpaper and theme switchers, replacing the cramped popups.
  * The wallpaper switcher can target one monitor or all of them, with the
    scope toggle sitting directly above the wallpaper rail.
  * Wallpaper thumbnails are cached pre-sized on disk, so the switcher opens
    from cache instead of decoding full-size sources every time.
  * Gentoo has a publisher script and a weekly drift alarm.

 -- Brad <brad@vanillagreen>  Tue, 25 Aug 2026 04:32:15 +0000

vgs-shell (0.3.0-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Split the extras into their own release bundle: the shell download drops
    from ~1.1 GiB to ~71 MiB, with themes fetched on demand from the catalog.
  * vgs-shell-assets carries every other bundled theme, wallpaper and icon theme.

 -- Brad <brad@vanillagreen>  Thu, 20 Aug 2026 00:00:00 +0000

vgs-shell (0.2.0-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Widget, launcher, greeter and theming fixes across the shell.
  * Declare the full runtime and optional dependency set.
  * Split the optional themes, wallpapers and icon themes into vgs-shell-assets.
  * Take over org.freedesktop.Notifications so the notification centre works.

 -- Brad <brad@vanillagreen>  Wed, 19 Aug 2026 00:00:00 +0000

